From: Yinxing Hou <yihou@crsuse2-slog-005.us-east2-a.compute.internal>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 06:28:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docker: v0521 + Mooncake #4340 (HIP IPC sub-allocation
 relocation) image recipe

Port of kvcache-ai/Mooncake#4340 (e8062249) to faae8dd4: hip_transport.{h,cpp}
verbatim, transfer_engine_impl.cpp unregister hunks re-based. The full PR diff
does not apply to faae8dd4 (NVLink/tests drift); those files are not compiled
under USE_HIP. New .yihou copies of the Dockerfile and mooncake build script;
committed originals untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
